Could you please:
1) Order these labs before my visit: CBC with indices, ferritin/iron/TIBC, CMP (creatinine/eGFR), B12/folate, and INR if applicable.
2) Advise whether, given my age and anemia, you recommend a referral to GI (colonoscopy and/or EGD) — especially if you think this is likely to be iron deficiency or GI blood loss.
3) Review my blood‑pressure plan at my visit — I can send a home BP log beforehand.

If you prefer, I’m happy to schedule a visit or speak by phone. Thank you.

Best,
[Your name]

