Questions to ask about hypertension management
- What blood-pressure target do you recommend for me, given my AF and heart‑failure history? (Many guidelines aim for <130/80 if tolerated, but individual factors matter.)
- Given my heart‑failure history, are there preferred antihypertensive classes you’d prioritize (ACE inhibitor/ARB/ARNI, beta‑blocker, diuretic, mineralocorticoid antagonist)? Should any meds be started, stopped or adjusted?
- How does my kidney function (creatinine 110 — please confirm units and eGFR) affect medication choices/doses (especially ACEi/ARB, diuretics, and metformin)?
