- Should we check for other causes first (eg, celiac testing, B12/folate) or send directly to GI?

Tests and info to bring to the visit (recommended)
- Recent blood tests: CBC (with hemoglobin, MCV), iron panel (ferritin, iron, TIBC or transferrin saturation), BMP (creatinine, electrolytes), eGFR, A1c (if diabetic), LFTs, B12/folate if indicated
