- New onset chest pain, severe shortness of breath, fainting or near‑syncope, sudden rapid weight gain (fluid retention), sudden drop in urine output, black/tarry stools, large-volume rectal bleeding, or very low hemoglobin symptoms (severe weakness, confusion).

